{"parentUuid":"124a69c7-670c-45cd-a5ee-5ab8189a38c4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgHZ5wgbY4udiZoX4Aa3U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XC7atjpNhvduoha9bYBxLH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/src/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/calibration && git add resources/jusprin/agent/protocol.json resources/jusprin/ui/icons/lucide-map.json resources/jusprin/ui/icons/save.svg resources/jusprin/ui/icons/thermometer.svg src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin tests/agent/test_agent_bridge.cpp tests/agent/test_tool_coordinator.cpp tests/shell/shell_harness.cpp && git status --short | grep -v \"^M \\|^A \" ; cat > /c/Users/guitest/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--src-JusPrin/e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258/scratchpad/msg-board5.txt <<'EOF'\nSave a calibration result only when the person presses Save preset\n\nBoard 5: in the project chat, a settings preview with persistAs from the\nAgent carries a proposal the page draws as the design system's Tool\nActivity card, in the Agent's bubble under its words: the title, the new\npreset's name, the setting with its saved and new values, that the base\npreset is unchanged, then Save preset and \"Pick another <block|tile|\nheight|line|corner>\". Nothing is written until Save preset, which has the\napp apply exactly the previewed patch against the preview's own session\nand revision (a settings change since makes it stale). The Agent's own\nsettings_apply_patch with persistAs is refused there (needs_person); the\nprinter panel and MCP clients keep saving their own presets.\n\nA save that succeeds posts a receipt note (Chat/Receipt, \"Saved: <name>\")\nwhose text tells the model, and starts its turn. A message of the person's\nafter the preview closes the card (\"Not saved\"), and the host refuses a\nstale press. New page message save_proposal, capability proposals.\n\nAdds lucide-static 1.47.0's save and thermometer icons, byte for byte.\nThe calibration skill now proposes with the preview and never applies\nthe save itself. The calibration capture covers the photo turn, the card\nand the save.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\nGIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0 git commit -q -F /c/Users/guitest/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--src-JusPrin/e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258/scratchpad/msg-board5.txt </dev/null && git log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the board 5 work"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":652,"cache_read_input_tokens":301924,"output_tokens":1035,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":85},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":652,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1035,"cache_read_input_tokens":301924,"cache_creation_input_tokens":652,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":652},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01XC7atjpNhvduoha9bYBxLH":{"command":"cd /c/src/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/calibration && git add resources/jusprin/agent/protocol.json resources/jusprin/ui/icons/lucide-map.json resources/jusprin/ui/icons/save.svg resources/jusprin/ui/icons/thermometer.svg src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin tests/agent/test_agent_bridge.cpp tests/agent/test_tool_coordinator.cpp tests/shell/shell_harness.cpp && git status --short | grep -v \"^M \\|^A \" ; cat > /c/Users/guitest/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--src-JusPrin/e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258/scratchpad/msg-board5.txt <<'EOF'\nSave a calibration result only when the person presses Save preset\n\nBoard 5: in the project chat, a settings preview with persistAs from the\nAgent carries a proposal