{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01HtB7VeNGPRuA7KgRBBC6gF","lastSequenceNum":0,"ownerAccountUuid":"7911d73c-5552-4877-a943-6a0eba3d7c4d","ownerOrganizationUuid":"68a648b0-98a4-49c7-902b-ff471f8d1d46"}
{"parentUuid":"872e5adf-3c3d-4a03-b52b-d543af1b8c95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgHZ7iwvnPFAhcSby5xmF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Board 5 now matches the board. The images above show the board on the left and the app on the right.\n\nWhen a calibration result is ready, the Agent's reply carries the card inside its bubble, under its words. The card has:\n- the title, \"Save 215 °C as a new filament preset\";\n- the new preset's name, the temperature change (\"Nozzle temperature 220 → 215 °C\"), and \"Bambu PLA Basic itself is unchanged\";\n- the **Save preset** and **Pick another block** buttons.\n\nYour photo shows as the file chip, as you chose.\n\n**How saving works now**\n- Nothing is written until you press Save preset. The app then saves exactly what the card shows.\n- If a setting changed after the card appeared, the save fails with a message instead of saving something different.\n- The Agent can no longer save a preset itself in the project chat. If it tries, the app refuses and tells it to use the card. This applies to any preset save in the project chat, not only calibration. The printer panel and MCP clients still save their own presets.\n- Once saved, a receipt line appears (\"Saved: Bambu PLA Basic · Workshop X1C calibrated\") and the Agent replies to it.\n- If you send any message after the card instead of pressing a button, the card says \"Not saved\" and pressing it later saves nothing.\n\n**What isn't on the board**\n- \"Not saved\" and an error line for a failed save are states the board doesn't draw.\n- I added the Lucide save and thermometer icons, copied byte for byte from the pinned icon package.\n\n**Checks**\n- New tests for the card, the save and the receipt pass.\n- The full test suites show only failures that were there before this work: three line-ending failures in the page tests and the old pick-attachment test.\n- The capture run went through the photo, the card, Save preset and the receipt with every check passing.\n\n**Not done or not verified**\n- The calibration skill's wording changed, so its recorded prompt-test cases need re-recording. I haven't run any live model.\n- Committed as 2b94973cf8, not pushed.\n- The app you were testing is still the old build.\n\nDoes board 5 match, so I can move on to board 6 (the receipt with Undo)?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":920,"cache_read_input_tokens":304722,"output_tokens":704,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":920,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":704,"cache_read_input_tokens":304722,"cache_creation_input_tokens":920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":920},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgHZ7i8KJmnXHsM3aKuzb","requestRef":"8ccbf103-d938-4bbe-80b6-63dc0932a47b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"3a09413a-8785-40b3-a80f-892107723f6f","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:00:42.742Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin\\.claude\\worktrees\\calibration","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"claude/calibration","slug":"steady-sparking-swan"}
