{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","hash":"1bc77dbcbaf2a6e7638fe6767222634c9abd594c5bbd5336fc25c51ba604eb8d","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Board 6 mostly needs Undo. Checking what the printer receipt's Undo does today, so the saved-preset Undo can work the same way."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01D5EdQz8rKL6DeDhECvG5aS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/src/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/calibration/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin && sed -n 686,730p PrinterSetup/PrinterConversation.cpp","description":"Read the printer receipt's Undo"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","hash":"ad8ce399e4f5f53ff9263b45527e52e11f3cc3edcce45120ea0520112c4bec53","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D5EdQz8rKL6DeDhECvG5aS","type":"tool_result","content":"void PrinterConversation::undo_add(const std::string& block_id)\n{\n    json* receipt = nullptr;\n    for (json& block : m_blocks)\n        if (block.value(\"id\", std::string()) == block_id && block.value(\"kind\", std::string()) == \"added\")\n            receipt = &block;\n    // A second tap that arrived before the page redrew the first has nothing\n    // left to undo.\n    if (receipt == nullptr || receipt->value(\"removed\", false))\n        return;\n\n    // Orca's own delete, as Home's \"Remove printer…\" runs it: the printer the\n    // project was set up for gives way to the profile it was based on.\n    const std::string name = receipt->at(\"printer\").at(\"name\");\n    if (const std::string problem = m_backend.remove_printer(name); !problem.empty()) {\n        m_host.post_note(\"Undo did not remove \" + name + \": \" + problem);\n        m_host.session_changed();\n        return;\n    }\n    // printer_add saves a printer based on a shipped profile, which Orca\n    // deletes without asking; only a printer of the person's own design can\n    // be kept by declining there.\n    if (!saved(name).name.empty())\n        throw std::logic_error(\"Removing an added printer left it saved\");\n\n    if (m_connecting == name)\n        abandon_connection();\n    (*receipt)[\"removed\"] = true;\n    // The same printer can now be added again, and nothing here is about it.\n    for (auto added = m_added.begin(); added != m_added.end();)\n        added = added->second == name ? m_added.erase(added) : std::next(added);\n    if (m_printer_name == name)\n        m_printer_name.clear();\n    if (m_prepared == name)\n        m_prepared.clear();\n    m_host.post_note(\"The person tapped Undo on the receipt: \" + name + \" is removed and is no longer one of their printers.\");\n    m_host.printers_changed();\n    m_host.session_changed();\n    m_host.start_turn();\n}\n\n} // namespace Slic3r::GUI::JusPrin::PrinterSetup","is_error":false}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","hash":"d68a51860b90618800233ba367888098db0984e6f30cfa0d0ea8832fade5c61a","message":{"role":"system","content":"# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: C:\\src\\JusPrin\\.claude\\worktrees\\calibration\\src\\slic3r\\GUI\\JusPrin (was C:\\src\\JusPrin\\.claude\\worktrees\\calibration)\n\n<total_tokens>14983774 tokens left</total_tokens>"}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","hash":"29d44ee0057c56061ed316f7ec2b2854be8d3f3658ce65df111bb44517cb290b","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Before building Undo I need two decisions; the board doesn't say what Undo does or what the receipt shows afterwards."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XVsZHA95yPoU1XByHYQuZm","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"What should Undo on the \"Saved: <preset>\" receipt do?","header":"Undo","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Remove the preset (Recommended)","description":"Like the printer receipt's Undo: this test goes back to the filament it started on, and the new copy is deleted. When the save went into an existing copy (a second test), Undo puts back that copy's previous values instead. The receipt then reads \"Removed: <name>\" with no button, and the Agent is told and replies."},{"label":"Only switch back","description":"Keep the saved copy in the filament list; Undo only puts this test project back on the filament it started on. The receipt then reads \"Switched back to <base>\"."}]},{"question":"The save also adds a change-log row under the card: \"Switched to Bambu PLA Basic · Workshop X1C calibrated — Agent, filament\". Board 6 has none, and it credits the Agent although you pressed Save preset. What should happen to it?","header":"Change row","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Hide it (Recommended)","description":"The receipt already says what was saved and that this test uses it, so the row from an approved save is left out of the thread, as the board draws it."},{"label":"Keep, credit you","description":"Keep the row but credit it to the person, since the save was their press."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
