approved save and its Undo made, as the board does. The proposal\nnames its preset by Orca's alias, which the receipt repeats.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\nGIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0 git commit -q -F /c/Users/guitest/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--src-JusPrin/e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258/scratchpad/msg-board6.txt </dev/null 2>/dev/null; git log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the board 6 work"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01BiZN9nj3doXvVBj5oGSKD3":{"cwd":"/c/src/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/calibration"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgHfPPdy9GKWfMYHaY5h5","requestRef":"a3ae2ae8-4460-4398-af83-48bbb478e9f4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"38a85a89-2ef3-447c-9692-8ae3b7c1eaa9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:22:57.079Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin\\.claude\\worktrees\\calibration","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"steady-sparking-swan"}
