{"parentUuid":"9c2eec66-4a23-47e1-b62f-84866f87be6d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgHfQnsVTSibcaurywnfc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Board 6 now matches the board. The three images above show the board, the app after Save preset, and the app after Undo.\n\n**After Save preset**\n- The receipt reads \"Saved: Bambu PLA Basic · Workshop X1C calibrated\", with the saved setting under it and **Undo** on the right.\n- The Agent's reply follows, with the \"Run the flow test next\" choice.\n- The \"Switched to… · Agent, filament\" change row no longer appears, as you chose. The row from Undo is hidden the same way.\n\n**Undo**, as you chose:\n- **New copy:** this test goes back to the filament it started on and the copy is deleted. JusPrin uses OrcaSlicer's own way of deleting a preset, including removing it from the cloud.\n- **Saved into an existing copy (a second test):** Undo puts that copy's earlier values back.\n- **Afterwards:** the receipt reads \"Removed: <name> — Deleted from your filaments. This test uses Bambu PLA Basic again.\" with no button. The Agent is told and replies. The skill now tells it to ask what you'd pick instead.\n- Undo is only offered for filament presets. Calibration only writes filament presets, so that covers every case today.\n\n**One difference from the board**\n- The board's setup card still shows \"Gray PETG\" after the save, but its own note says the test project already uses the new preset. The app shows the preset actually in use, \"Bambu PLA Basic · Workshop X1C calibrated\". I left that as it is.\n\n**Checks**\n- New tests for both Undo paths pass, and so do tests for the second press doing nothing and for the hidden rows.\n- In the real app, the capture run pressed Save preset and then Undo. Every check passed, including that the copy was deleted and the filament switched back.\n- The full suites show only the failures that were there before this work.\n\n**Things to know**\n- The disk filled up completely during this work. I deleted about 4,000 harness temp folders older than three hours, and there's now 188 GB free. Most of that space came back from something else on the machine, not from my cleanup.\n- The skill's wording changed again, so its recorded prompt tests still need re-recording. I haven't run any live model.\n- Committed as 0d9202835e, not pushed. The app you were testing is still the old build."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":868,"cache_read_input_tokens":389071,"output_tokens":744,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":868,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":389071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":868,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":868},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgHfQnShE5i3x9XPayPUT","requestRef":"33df9a07-f8a9-4eec-966e-efa1d3bad81d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"dec8cd72-48e2-483a-bf3f-71029ab409a0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:23:15.020Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin\\.claude\\worktrees\\calibration","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"steady-sparking-swan"}
