{"parentUuid":"f8fa4d16-425e-4d04-a153-b9f3fa5c3f85","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8bcbaeb6-a8ca-4f4c-93f9-6209a8f6bef9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SnFzE8b8ZtTGLRF2xJqo8C","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Title: 8 · On Home\nURL: http://127.0.0.1:18431/calibration-08-home.dc.html\nSource element: <body>\n---\n8 · On Home\nThe test is an ordinary ProjectCard in the gallery, so it is found, reopened and deleted like any other. Its one status line names the preset it produced; its thumbnail is the sliced tower. Backpack hook still says Gray PETG, because nothing switched it.\nBackpack hook\nSliced, ready · Gray PETG\nTemperature test · Gray PETG\nSaved Gray PETG · MK4 calibrated"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"8 · On Home\" (\"http://127.0.0.1:18431/calibration-08-home.dc.html\")"}]}]},"uuid":"7dde8927-d8b7-480d-bbd6-e3301bb783cb","timestamp":"2026-10-22T19:25:22.972Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"Title: 8 · On Home\nURL: http://127.0.0.1:18431/calibration-08-home.dc.html\nSource element: <body>\n---\n8 · On Home\nThe test is an ordinary ProjectCard in the gallery, so it is found, reopened and deleted like any other. Its one status line names the preset it produced; its thumbnail is the sliced tower. Backpack hook still says Gray PETG, because nothing switched it.\nBackpack hook\nSliced, ready · Gray PETG\nTemperature test · Gray PETG\nSaved Gray PETG · MK4 calibrated"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"8 · On Home\" (\"http://127.0.0.1:18431/calibration-08-home.dc.html\")"}],"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f8fa4d16-425e-4d04-a153-b9f3fa5c3f85","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin\\.claude\\worktrees\\calibration","sessionId":"e7286