{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","hash":"14bf093a6a6f61c9fcc1c330d07167c9215dacee9eb1f87f9428f7bb287012ab","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"It's fork code (it isn't in upstream OrcaSlicer). The fix is one condition: fall back to the object's name only when the project has no name yet."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014uXUdQUDh1awaTuM1mt8Up","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/src/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/calibration && /c/Users/guitest/.local/python-3.13.9/python.exe - <<'PYEOF'\np=\"src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Workspace/ProjectAutosave.cpp\"\nraw=open(p,\"rb\").read().decode(\"utf-8\"); nl=\"\\r\\n\" if \"\\r\\n\" in raw else \"\\n\"; s=raw.replace(\"\\r\\n\",\"\\n\")\no='''        frozen.version.project_name = m_project_name.empty() ? plater_name : m_project_name;\n        if ((plater_name.empty() || plater_name == _L(\"Untitled\").ToUTF8().data()) &&\n            !m_plater.model().objects.empty())'''\nn='''        frozen.version.project_name = m_project_name.empty() ? plater_name : m_project_name;\n        // A project with no name yet takes its first object's. One the store\n        // already named keeps it: a reopened project's Orca name reads\n        // Untitled, and its next version must not rename it.\n        if (m_project_name.empty() && (plater_name.empty() || plater_name == _L(\"Untitled\").ToUTF8().data()) &&\n            !m_plater.model().objects.empty())'''\nassert s.count(o)==1; s=s.replace(o,n)\nopen(p,\"wb\").write(s.replace(\"\\n\",nl).encode(\"utf-8\")); print(\"ok\")\nPYEOF\ncd /c/b/cal && cmake --build . --config Release --target shell_integration_harness workspace_adapter_integration_harness -- -m -v:minimal 2>&1 | grep -E \"error C|LNK1|-> .*harness\\.exe\"","description":"Keep a stored project name on later versions; rebuild","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
