{"parentUuid":"c167538e-7178-46ce-a973-7c4b5ba8a8c8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgHsCpW3GsNsRTNbox3HN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The app is built from the latest commit and running on Home, ready for you to test.\n\n- **Commits:** everything was already committed on `claude/calibration`, so there was nothing new to commit. The newest commits are d56157f033 (board 8), 9e6593b249 (the Home rename fix), a1f841126c (board 7), 0d9202835e (board 6) and 2b94973cf8 (board 5). The report and review images stay untracked, per your rule. Nothing is pushed.\n- **Build:** I rebuilt the Agent and Home pages and the app in `C:\\b\\cal`. It's running as process 15604 (`C:\\b\\cal\\src\\Release\\orca-slicer.exe`), started with the software renderer like before. I only checked that it opened on Home and responds; I didn't click through any flow.\n- **Before you start:** Home shows \"No projects yet\", so begin with **New** or **Import** to get a project to calibrate. There's no OpenGL DLL in the build folder; if the 3D view stays blank once a project is open, tell me.\n\nYou can test the whole flow:\n- **Ask for a test:** use the **Calibrate…** row (printer chip, filament slot or Home printer card), or describe stringing in the chat.\n- **Read the result:** send a photo of the tower, then press **Save preset** on the card.\n- **Take it back:** **Undo** on the receipt deletes the copy.\n- **Reopen:** open another project, then reopen the test from Home to see the board 7 warning.\n\nThe Agent here is whichever model you have set up, not the stand-in the harness uses. Its wording will vary, and the reopened-test choices only appear if the model follows the skill."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":335,"cache_read_input_tokens":546528,"output_tokens":547,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":335,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":547,"cache_read_input_tokens":546528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":335,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":335},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgHsCpAh41g8YQVWFHJVE","requestRef":"f5726514-6e23-4c15-9716-85cd662d7fc1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"67c22fad-3721-4ce3-8553-93cdbebd7440","timestamp":"2026-10-22T19:57:52.992Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"claude/calibration","slug":"steady-sparking-swan"}
