{"parentUuid":"814320a5-9280-4e26-88d1-e95aa45ebedf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJ9CwaneGzCJYMrHmdpn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The default data folder is `%APPDATA%\\JusPrin2` (`C:\\Users\\guitest\\AppData\\Roaming\\JusPrin2`). I didn't pass `--datadir` when I launched it, so the instance running now already uses that folder.\n\nTo launch it yourself with that folder:\n\n```bash\nGALLIUM_DRIVER=llvmpipe /c/b/cal/src/Release/orca-slicer.exe &\n```\n\nOr, naming the folder explicitly:\n\n```bash\nGALLIUM_DRIVER=llvmpipe /c/b/cal/src/Release/orca-slicer.exe --datadir \"$APPDATA/JusPrin2\" &\n```\n\nClose the instance I started (process 15604) first, so two copies don't share the same data folder.\n\nThe \"No projects yet\" on Home is therefore what that folder holds. If you were expecting your projects there, they're probably in a different data folder; tell me where your usual JusPrin keeps them and I'll give you the command for that folder."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":700,"cache_read_input_tokens":547453,"output_tokens":581,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":250},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":700,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":581,"cache_read_input_tokens":547453,"cache_creation_input_tokens":700,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":700},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgJ9CwFhXQdSgwocFcXXb","requestRef":"ca21ea15-272f-40e4-81e9-ab7ced76c4a1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3