{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01HtB7VeNGPRuA7KgRBBC6gF","lastSequenceNum":0,"ownerAccountUuid":"7911d73c-5552-4877-a943-6a0eba3d7c4d","ownerOrganizationUuid":"68a648b0-98a4-49c7-902b-ff471f8d1d46"}
{"parentUuid":"425fdaa9-226a-4f71-9c73-649704c6a1ba","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a2d19e6f-cea9-4c9e-bae6-6360cca68abc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A9vmtKvyVQM1gYpiH471QP","type":"tool_result","content":"1146:        {\"calibration_generate\", \"Make a calibration test\",\n        {\"calibration_generate\", \"Make a calibration test\",\n         // Both adapters: an external client reads the result; for the\n         // in-app Agent the test's project also opens its chat with summary.\n         \"Replace the open project with one of OrcaSlicer's calibration tests, as a project of its own: temperature, a tower \"\n         \"of blocks from start °C at the bottom to end °C at the top, 5 °C apart (start hotter than end, both multiples of \"\n         \"5); flow, OrcaSlicer's flow-ratio tiles (pass 1 or 2, default 1; linear true, the default, for its YOLO tiles, \"\n         \"false for its classic ones); or pressure_advance (method tower, the default, line or pattern; extruderType \"\n         \"direct_drive, the default, or bowden; start, end and step default to OrcaSlicer's for the method and extruder). \"\n         \"Call it only once the person has agreed to the open project being closed. That project is first saved to its \"\n         \"version history, where it can be restored; its unsaved preset edits are then dropped. The test edits the \"\n         \"presets of its own project for itself, unsaved. projectName names the new project. The result is what \"\n         \"OrcaSlicer made: the plate, its objects (the flow tiles are named for their change) and the range it applies, \"\n         \"with summary, a sentence saying what it made. IDs from before are no longer valid afterwards.\",\n         object_schema({{\"test\", {{\"type\", \"string\"}, {\"enum\", json::array({\"temperature\", \"flow\", \"pressure_advance\"})}}},\n                        {\"projectName\", {{\"type\", \"string\"}, {\"maxLength\", 256}}},\n                        {\"start\", number_schema()}, {\"end\", number_schema()}, {\"step\", number_schema()},\n                        {\"method\", {{\"type\", \"string\"}, {\"enum\", json::array({\"tower\", \"line\", \"pattern\"})}}},\n                        {\"extruderType\", {{\"type\", \"string\"}, {\"enum\", json::array({\"direct_drive\", \"bowden\"})}}},\n                        {\"pass\", {{\"type\", \"integer\"}, {\"enum\", json::array({1, 2})}}},\n                        {\"linear\", boolean_schema()}},\n                       {\"test\"}),\n         object_schema({{\"projectName\", string_schema()}, {\"test\", id}, {\"plateId\", id},\n                        {\"objects\", {{\"type\", \"array\"}, {\"maxItems\", 64},\n                                     {\"items\", object_schema({{\"objectId\", id}, {\"name\", string_schema()}}, {\"objectId\", \"name\"})}}},\n                        {\"applied\", object_schema({{\"start\", number_schema()}, {\"end\", number_schema()}, {\"step\", number_schema()},\n                                                   {\"method\", id}, {\"extruderType\", id}, {\"pass\", integer_schema()},\n                                                   {\"linear\", boolean_schema()}})},\n                        {\"messages\", list_schema(orca_message)}, {\"summary\", string_schema()},\n                        {\"sessionId\", id}, {\"revision\", revision}},\n                       {\"projectName\", \"test\", \"plateId\", \"objects\", \"applied\", \"messages\", \"summary\", \"sessionId\", \"revision\"}),\n         ActionClass::Mutation, ToolExposure::InApp | ToolExposure::Mcp, ToolAvailability::Always, ToolHandler::CalibrationGenerate},\nAgent/ToolRegistry.cpp:549:        if (!has_only(arguments, {\"test\", \"projectName\", \"start\", \"end\", \"step\", \"method\", \"extruderType\", \"pass\", \"linear\"}) ||\nAgent/ToolRegistry.cpp:551:            (arguments.contains(\"projectName\") &&\nAgent/ToolRegistry.cpp:552:             (!arguments[\"p