{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258","hash":"1b371ba0b51d010463b2a0441f816a5d6da6d7821be6c69eb0d3bb5002f3963c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now the adapter's generator call: no release first, and the project's own name put back with `set_project_filename`."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WvB3ybJu5ZDVzfnTgMYH43","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\guitest\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--src-JusPrin\\e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258\\scratchpad\\edit_r3_adapter.py","content":"import os\nos.chdir(r\"C:\\src\\JusPrin\\.claude\\worktrees\\calibration\")\n\n\ndef edit(path, pairs):\n    raw = open(path, \"rb\").read().decode(\"utf-8\")\n    nl = \"\\r\\n\" if \"\\r\\n\" in raw else \"\\n\"\n    s = raw.replace(\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\")\n    for o, n in pairs:\n        assert s.count(o) == 1, (path, o[:70])\n        s = s.replace(o, n)\n    open(path, \"wb\").write(s.replace(\"\\n\", nl).encode(\"utf-8\"))\n\n\nedit(\"src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Workspace/OrcaWorkspaceAdapter.cpp\", [\n(\"\"\"    // Every generator starts with Orca's own new_project, with its questions\n    // on, and calib_pa and calib_temp go on editing the presets when it is\n    // cancelled. Released here first, through the same path as an open, the\n    // generator's new_project replaces an empty project with no preset\n    // edited, so nothing asks; the release hook is told it has nothing to\n    // save, or it would keep that empty project as one of its own.\n    if (!release_project(request.project_name))\n        return CommandResult::failure(WorkspaceError::UnavailableOperation, \"The open project could not be saved, so it stays open\");\n    const GeneratingCalibration generating(m_generating_calibration);\n\"\"\", \"\"\"    // The caller opened the calibration project this test is made in. Every\n    // generator starts with Orca's own new_project all the same; the release\n    // hook is told the project goes on, so it neither saves nor asks (handoff\n    // fact 9). The generator then names the project after its test, and the\n    // project's own name is put back before anything saves a version of it.\n    const wxString            project_name = m_plater.get_project_name();\n    const GeneratingCalibration generating(m_generating_calibration);\n\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    // The generator names the project after its test; the caller's name, when\n    // it gave one, is the one the person sees on Home.\n    if (!request.project_name.empty()) {\n        m_plater.set_project_name(from_u8(request.project_name));\n        m_plater.update_title_dirty_status();\n    }\n\"\"\", \"\"\"    // With an extension to drop, so a dot in the name (\"0.4 nozzle\") is kept.\n    m_plater.set_project_filename(project_name + \".3mf\");\n    m_plater.update_title_dirty_status();\n\"\"\"),\n])\n\n# The forwarder this branch had added to OrcaSlicer's Plater goes.\nedit(\"src/slic3r/GUI/Plater.cpp\", [\n(\"\"\"void Plater::set_project_name(const wxString& project_name)\n{\n    p->set_project_name(project_name);\n}\n\n\"\"\", \"\"),\n])\nprint(\"ok\")\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015AVc2gKxWNjbwpo4f1fD9q","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"/c/Users/guitest/.local/python-3.13.9/python.exe /c/Users/guitest/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--src-JusPrin/e7286644-9c40-4163-89b2-1b9685541258/scratchpad/edit_r3_adapter.py && cd /c/src/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/calibration && git diff f323db81c7 -- src/slic3r/GUI/Plater.hpp src/slic3r/GUI/Plater.cpp | head -30; grep -rn \"set_project_name(\" src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin tests | grep -v \"p->set_project_name\\|m_project_name\" | head","description":"Rework the adapter and see the remaining Plater change"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
