{"parentUuid":"f1a43ad5-9f45-415f-93ba-653e6b78acc5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a2d19e6f-cea9-4c9e-bae6-6360cca68abc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012ibch6QB4YcHVLk43zxyhE","type":"tool_result","content":"\u001b[31m   \u001b[31m×\u001b[31m project skills\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mloads every SKILL.md, sorted by name, one per trigger\u001b[90m 14\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[31m\u001b[39m\n\u001b[31m   \u001b[31m×\u001b[31m the skill for a slice that did not succeed\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mstands on the standing rules and stays well under the file-loaded skill\u001b[90m 1\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[31m\u001b[39m\n\u001b[31m   \u001b[31m×\u001b[31m the skill for a setup to check against the print's purpose\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mopens under the standing rules and stays short\u001b[90m 2\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[31m\u001b[39m\n\u001b[31m   \u001b[31m×\u001b[31m the skill for calibrating a filament\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mis read on demand, listed by its description, and fits in the app\u001b[90m 1\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[31m\u001b[39m\n\u001b[31m   \u001b[31m×\u001b[31m the skill for calibrating a filament\u001b[2m > \u001b[22masks before the project closes, unless the person already said yes\u001b[90m 8\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[31m\u001b[39m\n\u001b[31m   \u001b[31m×\u001b[31m the skill for calibrating a filament\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mrecords the test, then reads a reopened one by the workspace's calibration fact\u001b[90m 6\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[31m\u001b[39m\n\u001b[31m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\u001b[1m\u001b[7m Failed Tests 6 \u001b[27m\u001b[22m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\u001b[39m\n\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\u001b[7m FAIL \u001b[27m\u001b[22m\u001b[39m src/skills.test.ts\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mproject skills\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mloads every SKILL.md, sorted by name, one per trigger\n\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\u001b[7m FAIL \u001b[27m\u001b[22m\u001b[39m src/skills.test.ts\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mthe skill for a slice that did not succeed\u001b[2m > \u001b[22mstands on the sta